abstract: "Curated research papers for Niodoo, Jason Van Pham's runtime that applies physics-inspired forces to a frozen language model's hidden state, with a model-emitted control channel and a durable store outside the weights. Losses stay in the record. Papers spawned from unasked plan criteria are not in this git."
